38210>>>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
38213>>>>>        // Ajusta los botones del selector según la vista desde la que se haya navegado.
38213>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
38214>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
38215>>>>>
38215>>>>>        Case Begin
38215>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
38217>>>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
38217>>>>>                Case Break
38218>>>>>
38218>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
38221>>>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent lookup from a Zoom
38221>>>>>                Case Break
38222>>>>>
38222>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromMain)
38225>>>>>                // If from main, this is a probably a main-file lookup from a Zoom
38225>>>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38226>>>>>                Case Break
38227>>>>>
38227>>>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38227>>>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38227>>>>>
38227>>>>>        Case End
38227>>>>>
38227>>>>>    End_Procedure
