38981>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38984>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38984>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38984>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38984>>>>>        Handle hoDD
38984>>>>>
38984>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38985>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38986>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38987>>>>>
38987>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38987>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38988>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38989>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38990>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38991>>>>>
38991>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
38993>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
38994>>>>>        End
38994>>>>>>
38994>>>>>        Else Begin
38995>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38996>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38997>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38998>>>>>        End
38998>>>>>>
38998>>>>>    End_Procedure
